      "title": "World in Dreams",
      "description": "Close-up living simulation of one walled city and five villages: every inhabitant has a home, trade and daily routine, and a place inside buildings with interiors; everyone keeps the hours of their trade and season; money circulates in a closed economy with rents, taxes and prices; trades follow demand; people fall ill, have accidents and die; some steal, fight and kill, and those in power abuse it; fields follow the seasons and the weather of the year; wildlife roams. No tile grid; painted after the art bible. Protagonist, RPG and AI agents much later.",
